{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Convert invalid envelope paths into permanent SerDes failures.** `getPath()` is outside the guarded block, so a valid marked envelope containing an illegal path (for example, an embedded NUL) leaks `InvalidPathException` instead of the documented `SerDesException`. This bypasses normal SerDes error handling for operation replay. Catch invalid-path/security failures, reject non-absolute paths, wrap them in `SerDesException`, and add malformed-path tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7or1Ao","finding_digest":"b576a6f6927764f508fc75a12d94b604191f20c7923143828ac2e907b6df835e","finding_id":"arf_v1_wv3kn5uso5spkch4owqs3ffwaq","finding_key":"sdk/serde/filesystemserdes::readpayload::invalid-path-exception-leak","identity_key":"sdk/serde/filesystemserdes::readpayload::invalid-path-exception-leak","line":303,"observation_digest":"f507ec13b52283b6f586e52c77f381926953635aa64b9118709fd56ed48bdc73","observation_id":"aro_v1_6ud6ye5vekb3n5mg4uwhp44bsj","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/FileSystemSerDes.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T11:51:43Z","review_id":"arr_v1_4cfcdhnhu4cjdwq5ydjdu7e23t","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"75447029a3e45a916d1b015a190c241b810017ed","reviewer":"codex","start_line":303,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":672},"record_id":"art_v1_7yrkkzctukqj6hxjllhoewo5u3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T11:51:43Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
